# Miro API Access Token
#
# How to get your token:
# 1. Go to https://miro.com/app/settings/user-profile/apps
# 2. Click "Create new app" or select an existing app
# 3. Go to "OAuth & Permissions" tab
# 4. Under "Access tokens", generate a token with the following scopes:
#    - boards:read (required to read board data and connectors)
#
# Preferred: export MIRO_ACCESS_TOKEN as an environment variable (e.g. in ~/.zshrc) — it works
# wherever you run the script and survives plugin updates. This .env file is an optional fallback:
# copy it to `.env` (here, or in the directory you run the command from) and set your token below.
# A real exported env var always takes precedence over this file.

MIRO_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_miro_access_token_here
